name: ['Accumulated Knowledge', 'Aetherize', 'Banisher Priest', 'Captain of the Watch', 'Celestial Flare', 'Coiling Oracle', 'Court Street Denizen', 'Dauntless Onslaught', 'Decree of Justice', 'Dictate of Heliod', "Elspeth, Sun's Champion", 'Evolving Wilds', 'Explore', 'Explosive Vegetation', 'Forest', 'Gempalm Avenger', 'Grazing Gladehart', 'Gustcloak Harrier', 'Gustcloak Savior', 'Gustcloak Sentinel', 'Gustcloak Skirmisher', 'Icatian Javelineers', 'Inkwell Leviathan', 'Island', 'Kinsbaile Skirmisher', "Kiora's Follower", 'Kiora, the Crashing Wave', 'Kor Skyfisher', 'Lorescale Coatl', 'Loxodon Partisan', "Man-o'-War", 'Mighty Leap', "Mortal's Ardor", 'Mother of Runes', 'Nessian Asp', 'Netcaster Spider', 'Nimbus Swimmer', 'Noble Templar', 'Omenspeaker', 'Peel from Reality', 'Plains', 'Plasm Capture', 'Precinct Captain', 'Raise the Alarm', 'Scourge of Fleets', 'Sealock Monster', 'Secluded Steppe', 'Simic Sky Swallower', 'Soul Parry', 'Standing Troops', 'Sunlance', 'Surrakar Banisher', 'Temple of the False God', 'Time to Feed', 'Urban Evolution', 'Veteran Armorsmith', 'Veteran Swordsmith', 'Whelming Wave']
