VOC', 'VOW', 'W17', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOE', 'WWK', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['+1: Put three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens onto the battlefield.\\n−3: Destroy all creatures with power 4 or greater.\\n−7: You get an emblem with "Creatures you control get +2/+2 and have flying."', '+1: Until your next turn, prevent all damage that would be dealt to and dealt by target permanent an opponent controls.\\n−1: Draw a card. You may play an additional land this turn.\\n−5: You get an emblem with "At the beginning of your end step, put a 9/9 blue Kraken creature token onto the battlefield."', 'Battle cry (Whenever this creature attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.)', 'Choose target creature an opponent controls. When that creature dies this turn, you gain 3 life. Target creature you control fights that creature. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)', "Counter target spell. At the beginning of your next precombat main phase, add X mana in any combination of colors to your mana pool, where X is that spell's converted mana cost.", 'Cycling {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Gempalm Avenger, Soldier creatures get +1/+1 and gain first strike until end of turn.', 'Draw a card, then draw cards equal to the number of cards named Accumulated Knowledge in all graveyards.', 'Draw three cards. You may play an additional land this turn.', 'First strike\\nWhenever Precinct Captain deals combat damage to a player, put a 1/1 white Soldier creature token onto the battlefield.', 'Flash\\nCreatures you control get +2/+2.', "Flying, trample\\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Flying\\nNimbus Swimmer enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.', "Flying\\nWhen Kor Skyfisher enters the battlefield, return a permanent you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nWhenever Gustcloak Harrier becomes blocked, you may untap it and remove it from combat.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Gustcloak Skirmisher becomes blocked, you may untap it and remove it from combat.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature you control becomes blocked, you may untap that creature and remove it from combat.', 'G', 'Icatian Javelineers enters the battlefield with a javelin counter on it.\\n{T}, Remove a javelin counter from Icatian Javelineers: Icatian Javelineers deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may gain 2 life.', 'Other Soldier creatures you control get +0/+1.', 'Other Soldier creatures you control get +1/+0.', 'Prevent all damage one or two target creatures would deal this turn.', 'Put X 4/4 white Angel creature tokens with flying onto the battlefield.\\nCycling {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Justice, you may pay {X}. If you do, put X 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens onto the battlefield.', 'Put two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens onto the battlefield.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nWhenever Netcaster Spider blocks a creature with flying, Netcaster Spider gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', "Reach\\n{6}{G}: Monstrosity 4. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put four +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)", "Return all attacking creatures to their owner's hand.", "Return all creatures to their owners' hands except for Krakens, Leviathans, Octopuses, and Serpents.", "Return target creature you control and target creature you don't control to their owners' hands.", "Sealock Monster can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.\\n{5}{U}{U}: Monstrosity 3. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put three +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nWhen Sealock Monster becomes monstrous, target land becomes an Island in addition to its other types.", 'Search your library for up to two basic land cards and put them onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', 'Secluded Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} to your mana pool.\\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Sunlance deals 3 damage to target nonwhite creature.', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by the creature also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Target player sacrifices an attacking or blocking creature.', "Trample\\nIslandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'U', 'Up to two target creatures each get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Vigilance', 'Vigilance\\nOther Soldier creatures you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.\\nWhen Captain of the Watch enters the battlefield, put three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens onto the battlefield.', 'Vigilance\\nPlainscycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Plains card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', 'W', "When Banisher Priest enters the battlefield, exile target creature an opponent controls until Banisher Priest leaves the battlefield. (That creature returns under its owner's control.)", "When Coiling Oracle enters the battlefield, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a land card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put that card into your hand.", 'When Kinsbaile Skirmisher enters the battlefield, target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "When Man-o'-War enters the battlefield, return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'When Omenspeaker enters the battlefield, scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', "When Scourge of Fleets enters the battlefield, return each creature your opponents control with toughness X or less to its owner's hand, where X is the number of Islands you control.", "When Surrakar Banisher enters the battlefield, you may return target tapped creature to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever Gustcloak Sentinel becomes blocked, you may untap it and remove it from combat.', 'Whenever another white creature enters the battlefield under your control, tap target creature an opponent controls.', 'Whenever you draw a card, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Lorescale Coatl.', 'You may play an additional land this turn.\\nDraw a card.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card and put it onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}: Add {2} to your mana pool. Activate this ability only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{T}: Untap another target permanent.']
